Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 14:05:01 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] Add PEMAT-A/V, CDC IDD/ELL and CDC Inclusive Communication
 frameworks

- PEMAT-A/V (17 items, official AHRQ numbering, no cutoff) for video/animation
- CDC IDD/ELL product development tool (27 items, 90% threshold, Part A rule)
- CDC Inclusive Communication principles checklist with term scan
- Brief: Video / animation format and IDD audience switch these on
- Relabel PEMAT 70% as a working target, not an AHRQ cutoff
- Prompt builder passes item rules, N/A conditions and visual flags
- scripts/build-fw-reg.js regenerates FW_REG from the engine registry
- Ignore Archive/; start HISTORY.md change log

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
